  "pdf_cells": [
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          342.29918067226896,
          651.774455760095,
          545.220894117647,
          12.106455166270791
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "With a luxury brand of this stature, establishing the dealer network, along with a distinctive"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          668.8176249999999,
          575.9768201680673,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "level of service and a highly trained staff, are absolutely critical elements for sustained success."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          685.8607942399051,
          569.7579470588234,
          12.106442992874122
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Infiniti’s global expansion is a significant investment that must be executed flawlessly from the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          702.9039513064133,
          525.4150000000001,
          12.106430819477453
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "beginning. The launch of the Infiniti into any new market will therefore be very carefully"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          719.947132719715,
          548.8918928571428,
          12.106430819477396
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "considered, thoroughly developed and painstakingly implemented to ensure the successful"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          736.9903141330167,
          262.73092857142854,
          12.106442992874122
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "debut of a globally recognized luxury brand."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          342.29918067226896,
          600.6449723871734,
          535.1773756302521,
          12.106442992874122
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "South Korea represents a good first global market for Infiniti. The initial sales targets are"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          617.6881294536818,
          547.6062844537815,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "modest but will help build a solid foundation for Infiniti’s expansion into Russia, followed by"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          634.7312986935867,
          224.17194453781508,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "China and then ultimately into Japan."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          342.29918067226896,
          515.4291505344418,
          538.1982315126052,
          12.106455166270791
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "The brand’s overwhelming success in the United States led to the decision to take Infiniti"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          532.4723076009502,
          563.0003029411764,
          12.106455166270791
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "global as part of the NISSAN Value-Up Plan. Currently available in North America, the Middle"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          549.5154768408552,
          556.112268487395,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "East and Taiwan, Infiniti took its first step toward becoming a truly world-class brand with its"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          566.5586460807601,
          582.9467512605041,
          12.106442992874065
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "entry into South Korea in the summer of 2005. Exclusive Infiniti dealerships there will offer a full"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          583.6018031472684,
          525.7752142857142,
          12.106455166270791
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "passenger car lineup, including the G35 sedan and coupe, FX, Q45, and the all-new M."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          342.29918067226896,
          464.2996549881235,
          560.9341268907563,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Infiniti has been the fastest-growing luxury-car brand in the North American market for three"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          481.3428242280286,
          582.0725899159663,
          12.106442992874122
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "consecutive years. This success is based on a clear understanding of the Infiniti luxury customer"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          498.3859812945368,
          503.1241268907563,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "and building distinctive vehicles that surpass even their uncompromising standards."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          342.29918067226896,
          396.12696585510696,
          521.7411071428571,
          12.1064916864608
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "From the time of its U.S. launch in 1989, Infiniti has been such a brand. Built using the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          413.17015944180525,
          511.7839470588235,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "ultimate in Nissan technology and production skills, an Infiniti is a merging of spirited"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          430.2133286817102,
          581.993518487395,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "performance, innovation and art, and embodies the achievement of something deeper—a vibrant"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          447.2564979216153,
          291.3782142857143,
          12.106442992874008
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "alternative to the usual luxury-class competitors."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          327.9542280285035,
          567.5468584033614,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "In the realm of passenger vehicles, a luxury car is the thoroughbred all the others aspire to be."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          344.99743378859864,
          584.7478743697478,
          12.10645516627062
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Constructed differently and with infinite care, it is meant for passionate buyers with exceptionally"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          362.04063954869366,
          576.8026256302522,
          12.106442992874008
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "high expectations. A luxury car also demands extraordinary treatment; only the highest levels of"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          317.88368067226895,
          379.08383313539196,
          338.3129642857143,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "attention to customer desires, needs and service will do."
      }
    ],
    [
